                                "sense_id": "b770270b-6090-3d2b-8fc5-72fce2fda00f",
                                "text": "The ‘compound’ eyes of insects [...] are made up of large numbers of facets or ommatidia, and in this sense, our own eyes are ‘simple’."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
